---
import Section from "./Section.astro";
---

<Section
  id="install"
  title="Installing an unsigned app"
  lede="The first launch takes a few extra clicks. Only the first."
>
  <ol class="steps span-body" role="list">
    <li>
      <h3 class="title">Open the app</h3>
      <p>
        Double-click <strong>Audio Extractr</strong>. When macOS says it "can't verify the developer,"
        click <kbd>Done</kbd>, not "Move to Trash."
      </p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <h3 class="title">Allow it in Settings</h3>
      <p>
        Open <strong>System Settings</strong>, then <strong>Privacy &amp; Security</strong>, scroll to
        Security, and click <kbd>Open Anyway</kbd>.
      </p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <h3 class="title">Confirm</h3>
      <p>Authenticate and click <kbd>Open</kbd>. After that it launches normally.</p>
    </li>
  </ol>
</Section>

<style>
  .steps {
    list-style: none;
    counter-reset: step;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .steps li {
    position: relative;
    max-width: none;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding: var(--col-gap) 0 var(--col-gap) 39.5px;
  }

  .steps li:last-child {
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }

  .steps li::before {
    counter-increment: step;
    content: counter(step);
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: var(--col-gap);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.375rem, 1.9vw, 1.625rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.008em;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    color: var(--link);
  }

  h3 {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  p {
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  strong {
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 650;
  }

  kbd {
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 0.9em;
    background: var(--surface-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: 1px 6px;
    color: var(--text);
  }
</style>
